  "fallen": {
    "//": "Prologue rule (26.09.2026): a survivor lying where they fell - down with pain, or passed out from exhaustion - is found. On unsearched ground every check carries unexploredMultiplier times the resting chance; on searched ground, where resting is safe, it carries exploredMultiplier times the searching chance instead. A fight begun that way starts with the survivor down.",
    "unexploredMultiplier": 3,
    "exploredMultiplier": 0.5
  },
  "//": "undefined rates are per hour of exposure; at most maxEncountersPerExploration turn up in one search and the second is rarer. A search and every step onto unknown ground are checked every encounterCheckMinutes with the danger of that moment; the checks together carry exactly the table's chance.",
